Cell["\<\
What to observe: Starting from RandomSeed -> 42, L-BFGS converges in just 4 \
iterations to > 99.9999% fidelity, steering <Iz> smoothly from +1 at t = 0 to \
-1 at t = 2 ms.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"be8f73a2-e338-1448-aa7f-1d2ab0d47d1d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
3. Inspecting Results, Gradients, and Simulation Verification\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"4489b457-5c24-6742-aed1-e153bdb920a1"],

Cell["\<\
OptimalControlResult behaves like an Association with clean string accessors \
for fidelities, convergence status, gradient norms, and optimized control \
arrays. EvaluateOptimalControl evaluates the objective, fidelity, and \
analytical gradient for any supplied control array.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fdfda10e-2709-8a43-977e-c10ae9b2fe36"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

